{"seq":3,"slug":"remedy-duty-stack-order-engine","title":"救济税与常规/协定税的叠加顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-determination-engine/remedy-duty-stack-order-engine","wordCount":1866,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"救济税与常规-协定税的叠加顺序\">救济税与常规/协定税的叠加顺序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一票货物的应缴税额从来不是一个税率乘货值。真实情况是：基础最惠国税率（MFN）、自由贸易协定优惠税率（FTA/协定税率）、贸易救济税（ADD/CVD）、以及各类额外附加税（Section 301、Section 232 这类国家安全/301 措施）在<strong>同一个报关单上并存</strong>。它们之间是&quot;叠加&quot;还是&quot;替代&quot;、以及以什么为基数叠加，决定了 landed cost 是 30% 还是 55%。这一章的任务是把叠加顺序写成一个显式的、可审计的<strong>计算管线</strong>，而不是散落在各处的加法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[报关货值 customs value] --&gt; B[基础税率层]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[MFN 最惠国税率]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[FTA 协定优惠税率]&#10;    B1 --&gt; C{是否适用协定}&#10;    B2 --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[取协定税率: 替代 MFN]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[取 MFN 税率]&#10;    D --&gt; F[额外附加税层]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; F1[Ch99 附加税: 301/232]&#10;    F1 --&gt; G[贸易救济层]&#10;    G --&gt; G1[ADD 反倾销]&#10;    G --&gt; G2[CVD 反补贴]&#10;    G1 --&gt; H[合计应缴]&#10;    G2 --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[清算/退税调整]\">graph TD\n    A[报关货值 customs value] --&gt; B[基础税率层]\n    B --&gt; B1[MFN 最惠国税率]\n    B --&gt; B2[FTA 协定优惠税率]\n    B1 --&gt; C{是否适用协定}\n    B2 --&gt; C\n    C --&gt;|是| D[取协定税率: 替代 MFN]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[取 MFN 税率]\n    D --&gt; F[额外附加税层]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; F1[Ch99 附加税: 301/232]\n    F1 --&gt; G[贸易救济层]\n    G --&gt; G1[ADD 反倾销]\n    G --&gt; G2[CVD 反补贴]\n    G1 --&gt; H[合计应缴]\n    G2 --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[清算/退税调整]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>税率类型</th>\n<th>与下一层关系</th>\n<th>计算基数</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>MFN / FTA 协定税率</td>\n<td><strong>替代</strong>（二选一）</td>\n<td>报关货值</td>\n<td>GATT II 减让表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Ch99 附加税（301/232）</td>\n<td><strong>叠加</strong></td>\n<td>通常为报关货值</td>\n<td>国内法 + HTSUS Ch99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>ADD / CVD</td>\n<td><strong>叠加</strong></td>\n<td>报关货值（从价）</td>\n<td>WTO 反倾销/SCM 协定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>TRQ 内/外档差</td>\n<td><strong>替代</strong>（档位二选一）</td>\n<td>报关货值</td>\n<td>减让表中的配额承诺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>增值税/消费税</td>\n<td>叠加（以完税价格+关税为基数）</td>\n<td>完税价格 + 关税</td>\n<td>各国流转税法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第一层-mfn-与协定税率的替代关系\">第一层：MFN 与协定税率的替代关系</h2><h3 id=\"替代而非叠加\">替代而非叠加</h3><p>MFN 税率与 FTA 协定税率是<strong>替代</strong>关系，不是叠加关系。同一批货要么按协定税率（通常为零或低于 MFN），要么按 MFN 税率，取其一。这条看似显然，实际是差异高发点：当系统把 FTA 优惠做成&quot;在原税率上打折&quot;时，会算出一个既不等于协定税率也不等于 MFN 的第三个数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gatt-减让表的上限纪律\">GATT 减让表的上限纪律</h3><p>GATT 第二条（减让表）的纪律是：成员对进口产品给予的待遇&quot;不得低于&quot;其减让表规定的待遇——因此减让表里的约束税率是<strong>上限</strong>，实际征收可以更低（例如适用协定税率），但不得更高。因此叠加顺序的第一条硬规则是：<strong>基础层只产生一个税率</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function base_rate(entry, date):&#10;    if entry.has_valid_fta_claim(date):&#10;        return { rate: fta_rate(entry.hs, entry.fta_partner, date), layer: &#39;FTA&#39;, replaces: &#39;MFN&#39; }&#10;    return { rate: mfn_rate(entry.hs, date), layer: &#39;MFN&#39; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function base_rate(entry, date):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if entry.has_valid_fta_claim(date):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return { rate: fta_rate(entry.hs, entry.fta_partner, date), layer: 'FTA', replaces: 'MFN' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return { rate: mfn_rate(entry.hs, date), layer: 'MFN' }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>FTA 优惠的判定与凭证要求属于另一个主题——本 hub 不展开，只处理&quot;优惠税率如何参与叠加&quot;。本 hub 内的举证与原产地判定见 <a href=\"../remedy-compliance-procurement/non-preferential-origin-evidence\">非优惠原产地溯源与举证</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二层-ch99-附加税的叠加性质\">第二层：Ch99 附加税的叠加性质</h2><h3 id=\"ch99-附加税与产品税号并存\">Ch99 附加税与产品税号并存</h3><p>以美国为例，Section 301（依据《1974 年贸易法》第 301 节）与 Section 232（依据《1962 年贸易扩展法》第 232 节）的额外关税，通过 HTSUS <strong>第 99 章</strong>（Chapter 99）以附加税号的形式实现，与商品原本的 1-97 章税号<strong>并存</strong>。报关时同一商品同时申报原税号（决定 MFN 税率）和一个 9903.xx.xx 附加税号（决定额外税率）。USTR 公布的 301 行动分为四个清单：约 340 亿美元（List 1）、160 亿美元（List 2）、2000 亿美元（List 3）、3000 亿美元（List 4）。见 <a href=\"https://ustr.gov/issue-areas/enforcement/section-301-investigations/tariff-actions\">USTR Section 301 Tariff Actions</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一货多税号的建模要求\">一货多税号的建模要求</h3><p>这意味着工程上&quot;一个商品一个税率&quot;的模型必然不够：<strong>报关行必须支持一货多税号（multi-line tariff）</strong>，且不同税号行的税率累加。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entry_id&quot;: &quot;E-2026-000123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lines&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;line_no&quot;: 1, &quot;hts&quot;: &quot;7326.90.86&quot;, &quot;role&quot;: &quot;PRODUCT&quot;, &quot;rate_pct&quot;: 3.1, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;MFN&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;line_no&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;hts&quot;: &quot;9903.88.03&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;CH99_ADDL&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rate_pct&quot;: 25.0,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;SECTION_301&quot;,&#10;      &quot;authority&quot;: &quot;Trade Act of 1974 s.301&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;line_no&quot;: 3,&#10;      &quot;hts&quot;: &quot;9903.80.01&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;CH99_ADDL&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rate_pct&quot;: 25.0,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;SECTION_232&quot;,&#10;      &quot;authority&quot;: &quot;Trade Expansion Act of 1962 s.232&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;line_no&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;hts&quot;: &quot;7326.90.86&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;REMEDY&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rate_pct&quot;: 86.5,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;ADD&quot;,&#10;      &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;AD-2024-xxxx&quot;,&#10;      &quot;producer_id&quot;: &quot;P-8891&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;customs_value&quot;: 48000.0&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entry_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"E-2026-000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"line_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7326.90.86\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PRODUCT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MFN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"line_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9903.88.03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH99_ADDL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rate_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SECTION_301\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Trade Act of 1974 s.301\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"line_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9903.80.01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH99_ADDL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rate_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SECTION_232\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Trade Expansion Act of 1962 s.232\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"line_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7326.90.86\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REMEDY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rate_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ADD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AD-2024-xxxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"producer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P-8891\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customs_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48000.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>role</code> 字段是这套模型的关键：它让计算管线能按层归集，而不必从税号反推语义。同一税号 7326.90.86 在第 1 行是产品行、第 4 行是救济税行，语义不同、金额来源不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三层-救济税以货值为基数叠加\">第三层：救济税以货值为基数叠加</h2><h3 id=\"从量与从价的差异\">从量与从价的差异</h3><p>ADD/CVD 的从价税率同样以<strong>报关货值</strong>为基数，与 MFN/协定税率和 Ch99 附加税各自独立计算后加总，而不是在&quot;已含关税的价格&quot;上再乘。这一点在从量税（specific duty）情形下尤其要注意：从量税额以数量为单位计价，与货值脱钩，因此不能简单转化成百分比后参与同样的乘法管线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计算管线实现\">计算管线实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function compute_duty(entry):&#10;    base   = base_rate(entry)                      # MFN 或 FTA，二选一&#10;    ch99   = sum(l.rate for l in entry.lines if l.role == &#39;CH99_ADDL&#39;)&#10;    remedy = sum(remedy_amount(l, entry) for l in entry.lines if l.role == &#39;REMEDY&#39;)&#10;&#10;    duty_total = entry.customs_value * (base.rate + ch99) / 100 + remedy&#10;&#10;    # 流转税以&quot;完税价格 + 关税&quot;为基数，因此关税必须先算完&#10;    vat_base = entry.customs_value + duty_total&#10;    return { duty_total, vat: vat_base * vat_rate(entry.hs) }&#10;&#10;function remedy_amount(line, entry):&#10;    order = load_order(line.order_id)&#10;    if order.duty_form == &#39;AD_VALOREM&#39;:&#10;        return entry.customs_value * line.rate_pct / 100&#10;    if order.duty_form == &#39;SPECIFIC&#39;:&#10;        return line.rate_value * entry.quantity      # 从量：与货值无关&#10;    if order.duty_form == &#39;QUOTA&#39;:&#10;        return quota_duty(order, entry)              # 见第 3 章 TRQ\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function compute_duty(entry):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    base   = base_rate(entry)                      # MFN 或 FTA，二选一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ch99   = sum(l.rate for l in entry.lines if l.role == 'CH99_ADDL')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    remedy = sum(remedy_amount(l, entry) for l in entry.lines if l.role == 'REMEDY')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    duty_total = entry.customs_value * (base.rate + ch99) / 100 + remedy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 流转税以\"完税价格 + 关税\"为基数，因此关税必须先算完</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vat_base = entry.customs_value + duty_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return { duty_total, vat: vat_base * vat_rate(entry.hs) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function remedy_amount(line, entry):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    order = load_order(line.order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if order.duty_form == 'AD_VALOREM':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return entry.customs_value * line.rate_pct / 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if order.duty_form == 'SPECIFIC':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return line.rate_value * entry.quantity      # 从量：与货值无关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if order.duty_form == 'QUOTA':</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return quota_duty(order, entry)              # 见第 3 章 TRQ</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从量与从价混用时，landed cost 的敏感性完全不同：从价税随货值波动，从量税则&quot;货值越低、税率占比越高&quot;——这正是反倾销从量税设计上的意图：防止低价申报规避。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键情形下的叠加顺序\">关键情形下的叠加顺序</h3><p>关键情形（critical circumstances）下的追溯征收（见 <a href=\"../remedy-duty-mechanism/provisional-duty-deposit-sunset\">临时税、保证金与日落复审</a>）会<strong>改写某一层的生效区间</strong>，但不改变层与层之间的顺序。实现上应把&quot;追溯调整&quot;做成管线末端的独立调整项，而不是回改各层的基数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"duty_total = base + ch99 + remedy + retro_adjustment&#10;&#10;retro_adjustment:&#10;  = sum over entries in retroactive window of (final_rate - paid_rate) * customs_value&#10;  -- 依据 19 CFR 351.212 的方向性: 临时低于终裁时忽略, 高于终裁时退还\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>duty_total = base + ch99 + remedy + retro_adjustment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retro_adjustment:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = sum over entries in retroactive window of (final_rate - paid_rate) * customs_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 依据 19 CFR 351.212 的方向性: 临时低于终裁时忽略, 高于终裁时退还</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-landed-cost-引擎的接口\">与 landed cost 引擎的接口</h2><p>Landed cost（落地成本）是采购与定价侧的口径，它比&quot;关税&quot;宽：还包含运费、保险、港杂、代理费、以及可能的退税。税费引擎对 landed cost 的贡献必须<strong>分层输出而非只输出一个总额</strong>，否则采购团队无法回答&quot;换个供应国能省多少&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>landed cost 分项</th>\n<th>来源层</th>\n<th>是否受救济措施影响</th>\n<th>是否可退回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>货值（FOB/出厂价）</td>\n<td>采购合同</td>\n<td>间接（供应商可能转嫁）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国际运费与保险</td>\n<td>物流</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础关税（MFN/FTA）</td>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>特定情形可退（如退税政策）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ch99 附加税</td>\n<td>第 2 层</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>一般不可退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADD/CVD</td>\n<td>第 3 层</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>保证金多缴可退，见第 1 章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TRQ 配额外溢价</td>\n<td>第 4 层</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进口环节流转税</td>\n<td>第 5 层</td>\n<td>是（基数为含关税价）</td>\n<td>通常可抵扣</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因此税费引擎的对外接口应当返回分层结构，让采购侧可以做&quot;换源模拟&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entry_id&quot;: &quot;E-2026-000123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;landed_cost_breakdown&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;goods_value&quot;: 48000.0,&#10;    &quot;freight_insurance&quot;: 3200.0,&#10;    &quot;duty_base_mfn_or_fta&quot;: 1488.0,&#10;    &quot;duty_ch99_additional&quot;: 24000.0,&#10;    &quot;duty_trade_remedy&quot;: { &quot;ADD&quot;: 41520.0, &quot;CVD&quot;: 0.0 },&#10;    &quot;duty_quota_surcharge&quot;: 0.0,&#10;    &quot;vat_on_import&quot;: 23665.6&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;total_landed&quot;: 141873.6,&#10;  &quot;remedy_share_pct&quot;: 29.3&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entry_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"E-2026-000123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"landed_cost_breakdown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"goods_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"freight_insurance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3200.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"duty_base_mfn_or_fta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1488.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"duty_ch99_additional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"duty_trade_remedy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ADD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41520.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"CVD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"duty_quota_surcharge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"vat_on_import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">23665.6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"total_landed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">141873.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"remedy_share_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">29.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>remedy_share_pct</code> 这样的派生指标是采购决策的直接输入：当救济税占比接近或超过三成时，&quot;更换供应源或转口&quot;的可行性评估就要启动——这属于 <a href=\"../remedy-compliance-procurement/supplier-sourcing-substitution\">供应商/转口采购替代与成本</a> 的范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见顺序错误清单\">常见顺序错误清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误实现</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FTA 税率当&quot;折扣&quot;叠加在 MFN 上</td>\n<td>算出介于两者之间的税率</td>\n<td>少缴或多缴，稽查不符</td>\n<td>替代而非叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只建一个税号字段</td>\n<td>丢失 Ch99 附加税</td>\n<td>漏征 301/232 税</td>\n<td>一货多税号，<code>role</code> 分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>救济税以&quot;含税价&quot;为基数</td>\n<td>复合增长</td>\n<td>系统性高估</td>\n<td>各层均以报关货值为基数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从量税转成百分比再乘</td>\n<td>单位错乱</td>\n<td>金额失真</td>\n<td>从量按数量独立计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流转税在关税前计算</td>\n<td>基数偏小</td>\n<td>增值税少缴</td>\n<td>关税先算完，再算流转税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追溯调整回改层内数值</td>\n<td>历史不可审计</td>\n<td>无法对账</td>\n<td>追溯作为末端独立调整项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只输出税额总额</td>\n<td>无法做换源模拟</td>\n<td>采购决策缺数据</td>\n<td>输出分层结构 + 派生占比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>叠加顺序是显式管线：基础层（MFN <strong>或</strong> FTA，替代）→ Ch99 附加税（叠加）→ 救济税（叠加）→ TRQ 档差（替代）→ 流转税（以含关税价为基数）。</li>\n<li>一份报关单必须支持<strong>一货多税号</strong>，用 <code>role</code> 字段区分产品行/Ch99 行/救济税行。</li>\n<li>各层关税均以<strong>报关货值</strong>为基数独立计算后加总，绝不层层复合；从量税按数量独立计算。</li>\n<li>追溯征收是管线<strong>末端的独立调整项</strong>（依 19 CFR 351.212 的方向性），不回改层内数值。</li>\n<li>对 landed cost 的输出必须是分层结构 + 派生占比，才能支撑换源与定价决策。TRQ 的档位替代逻辑见 <a href=\"../tariff-rate-quota/trq-in-out-two-tier-rate\">TRQ 配额内/外两档税率</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"救济税与常规/协定税的叠加顺序","id":"救济税与常规-协定税的叠加顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"第一层：MFN 与协定税率的替代关系","id":"第一层-mfn-与协定税率的替代关系"},{"level":3,"text":"替代而非叠加","id":"替代而非叠加"},{"level":3,"text":"GATT 减让表的上限纪律","id":"gatt-减让表的上限纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"第二层：Ch99 附加税的叠加性质","id":"第二层-ch99-附加税的叠加性质"},{"level":3,"text":"Ch99 附加税与产品税号并存","id":"ch99-附加税与产品税号并存"},{"level":3,"text":"一货多税号的建模要求","id":"一货多税号的建模要求"},{"level":2,"text":"第三层：救济税以货值为基数叠加","id":"第三层-救济税以货值为基数叠加"},{"level":3,"text":"从量与从价的差异","id":"从量与从价的差异"},{"level":3,"text":"计算管线实现","id":"计算管线实现"},{"level":3,"text":"关键情形下的叠加顺序","id":"关键情形下的叠加顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"与 landed cost 引擎的接口","id":"与-landed-cost-引擎的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"常见顺序错误清单","id":"常见顺序错误清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"反规避：转口、改归类与微量阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-determination-engine/anti-circumvention-transshipment-rule"},"next":{"title":"TRQ 配额内/配额外的两档税率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/tariff-rate-quota/trq-in-out-two-tier-rate"}}